Ça va bien. Regarde, un sac mystère !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm good. Look, a mystery bag!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>C'est quelle couleur ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What colour is it?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Devine !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Guess!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>C'est rouge ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Is it red?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Non !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">No!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>C'est bleu ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Is it blue?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Oui ! C'est bleu !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes! It's blue!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Super !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Great!</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234561,"_nanoseconds":740000000}},{"id":"sscKFu3NA7mL4nKub1Zu","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":4,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l04-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Bonjour ! Ça va ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hello! How are you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Ç